 evels. No partner needed!\n\nEvery Friday\n- Rock ’n’ Roll: 19:00–20
 :00\n- Tango: 20:00–21:00 + Practica\n\nKREATIVHAUS\nFischerinsel 3\, 10
 179 Berlin – Mitte\n\nCome learn\, dance and enjoy the music! \nSee you 
 on the dance floor!\n----------\nQuelle: Veranstalter\n\nVeranstalter: Aar
 on Benchimol\n\nhttps://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/499404/Tango
