 he dance.\n- Entrée 2 € - donations welcome\nAperitif - 18:00 -19:00\n\
 n- Tango - Warm Up/ Introduction\nBasic steps:\nA first sip of rhythm- a s
 low awakening for the senses\n\n- Main Course - 19:00 - 22:00\nLa Milongui
 ta Nota Negra\nA rich blend of Argentine classics and hidden gems\, carefu
 lly seasoned by \n- DJ mojokojo\, \n\nBest enjoyed with drinks\, served al
 ongside with tempting bites \;)…\n\nLean in. Let the night melt on your 
