SUMMARY:Pre Party Berlin Encuentro Milonguero
LOCATION:Ballhaus Rixdorf\, Kottbusser Damm 76\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: Pre-Party BERLIN ENCUENTRO MILONGUERO 2026\nAn Open In
 vitation to the Entire Tango Community!\n\nBefore the magic of the BERLIN 
 ENCUENTRO MILONGUERO begins\, we warmly invite the entire tango community 
 to come together for a very special evening of tango\, embraces\, and frie
 ndship.\n\nToday on Thursday\, November 12th\, dancers from around the wor
 ld will start arriving in Berlin for the BEM 2026\, taking place from Nove
 mber 13th to 15th. This year\, we are proud to welcome participants from 3
 0 different nationalities\, all united by the same passion: \n\n... T A N 
 G O ...\n\nOur Pre-Party Milonga is open to everyone and is a wonderful op
 portunity for the local tango community and our international guests to me
 et\, dance\, and share unforgettable tandas before the main event begins.\
 n\nWhile the BEM activities from Friday through Sunday afternoon are reser
 ved for registered participants\, both the Pre-Party on Thursday night and
  the After-Party on Sunday night are open to all dancers.\n\nMusic by inte
 rnationally renowned\n\n- DJ Guillermo Monti\, \noriginally from Buenos Ai
 res and a beloved member of the Berlin tango scene for the past 15 years.\
 n\n- Thursday\, November 12th\n- 8:00 PM - 1:00 AM\n\nRixdorf Ballhaus Ber
 lin\nKottbusser Damm 76\, 10967 Berlin-Bezirk Neukölln\, Alemania\n\n- En
 trance: €15\n\nCome and celebrate the international spirit of tango\, me
 et dancers from every corner of the world\, and enjoy an evening filled wi
 th music\, connection\, and warm embraces.\nAnd if you're still thinking a
 bout joining the Berlin Encuentro Milonguero\, you can find more informati
 on and registration details on our website:\n- https://berlinencuentromilo
 nguero.com\n\nDon't forget: Today\, Thursday\, November 12th - a milonga f
 or everyone!\n\nBring your friends\, your tango shoes\, and your best embr
 ace. We look forward to welcoming you to the dance floor at Rixdorf Ballha
 us Berlin\n----------\nSource: https://www.facebook.com/events/16467735101
 74012\n\nVeranstalter: Guillermo Monti\n\nhttps://www.hoy-milonga.com/berl
 in/de/milonga/504018/Pre-Party-Berlin-Encuentro-Milonguero
URL:https://www.hoy-milonga.com/berlin/de/milonga/504018/Pre-Party-Berlin-E
 ncuentro-Milonguero
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
